          "image": "_finale behind eileen",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "waomq0",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "e: Thank you for viewing this tutorial."
        },
        {
          "id": "n4h03e",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "e: If you'd like to see a full Ren'Py game, select \\\"The Question\\\" in the launcher."
        },
        {
          "id": "3fqpp8",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "e: You can download new versions of Ren'Py from {a=https://www.renpy.org/}https://www.renpy.org/{/a}. For help and discussion, check out the {a=https://lemmasoft.renai.us/forums/}Lemma Soft Forums{/a}."
        },
        {
          "id": "kuycm6",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "e: We'd like to thank Piroshki for contributing my sprites; Mugenjohncel for Lucy, the band, and drawn backgrounds; and Jake for the magic circle."
        },
        {
          "id": "w5eux0",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "e: The background music is \\\"Sunflower Slow Drag\\\", by Scott Joplin and Scott Hayden, performed by the United States Marine Band. The concert music is by Alessio."
        },
        {
          "id": "79ii54",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "eileen vhappy",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "27y60j",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "e: We look forward to seeing what you create with Ren'Py. Have fun!"
        },
        {
          "id": "feml4j",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        },
